When integrating with your provider, rely on their SDKs to handle the heavy lifting securely.

```javascript
const stripe = require('stripe')(process.env.STRIPE_SECRET_KEY);

// Tokenize on the client using Stripe.js, then process on the server:
const paymentIntent = await stripe.paymentIntents.create({
