## 🛡️ Additional Security Enhancements

### 1. Token Blacklisting (for Revocation)
If you need the ability to revoke tokens before they expire (e.g., user logout), use a fast datastore like Redis.

```javascript
const redis = require('redis');
const client = redis.createClient();

const isTokenBlacklisted = async (jti) => {
  return (await client.get(`blacklist:${jti}`)) !== null;
};

const blacklistToken = async (jti, exp) => {
  const ttl = exp - Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);
  await client.setex(`blacklist:${jti}`, ttl, '1');
};
```

